Do not patch these files. Earlier copies carried two undocumented 4-byte
binary patches (libpp.a hal_mac.o: hal_init MAC-ready wait removed; libphy.a
phy_rx_cal.o: ram_iq_est_enable wait removed). The second disabled RX IQ
calibration and left the receiver deaf. Verify with:  sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS
